;==================================================
;Cuddle
;身をすり寄せる
;==================================================
;==================================================
;Optional: Determines if the standard description should be skipped.
;Return 0 if description and KOJO should be shown, 1 if description should be hidden and KOJO shown, 2 if description should be shown and KOJO hidden, and 3 if both description and KOJO should be hidden.
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COUNTER_MESSAGECHECK_K51_14
RETURN 0

@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COUNTER_K51_14
IF TALENT:51:恋人 && !RAND:2
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「Do you like me as your girlfriend?」
			PRINTFORML 「...You're a good %PRINT_MALE("boy:girl",MASTER)%friend, too.」
			PRINTFORMDL She hugs you tightly to show her sincerity.
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Am I clingy?」
			IF TALENT:51:恋慕
				PRINTFORML 「...It's your fault that I love you so much, you know.」
				PRINTFORMDL Seems you've sealed your fate.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「...I'm trying a little too hard, I guess.」
				PRINTFORMDL So she says, but she doesn't let go.
			ENDIF
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「How are you feeling? Everything okay?」
			PRINTFORML 「I'll give you some therapy, so keep doing your best.」
			PRINTFORMDL She hugs you tightly. You can feel her heartbeat...
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 「I'm collecting your cuddle debt.」
			PRINTFORMDL You wonder aloud how many cuddles you owe her.
			PRINTFORML 「According to the girlfriend contract, you're in debt for life, %PRINT_MALE("boyo:big girl",MASTER)%～」
	ENDSELECT
ELSEIF GETBIT(CFLAG:51:既成事実,1) || CFLAG:51:ヤラせちゃった
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORMDL She presses her body against yours and sighs happily.
			PRINTFORML 「I just like touching you, that's all.」
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Am I getting in the way?」
			PRINTFORMDL The way she's hugging you, you can't really move.
			PRINTFORML 「Stay a while, then～」
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「Stay there for a minute～...」
			PRINTFORMDL Caught in her grasp, you can't escape. She puts her arms around your waist and locks you in place.
			PRINTFORML 「I just wanna cuddle. Don't act like it's something bad...」
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORMDL She presses herself into you like she's trying to burrow inside of you.
			PRINTFORML 「Your body's just so huggable and cuddlable, I can't stop～」
	ENDSELECT
ELSE
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「I'm after your shirikodama.」
			PRINTFORMDL Nitori wears a mischievous grin when you turn to look at her in alarm.
			PRINTFORML 「Just kidding～ Haha, your face!」
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Boo!」
			PRINTFORMDL Is her grabbing onto you supposed to be scary?
			PRINTFORML 「I dunno, are you scared of me?」
			PRINTFORMDL Right now, her smiling face is too cute to be scared.
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「Tactical maneuver!」
			PRINTFORMDL You ask her what's tactical about her grabbing you like that.
			PRINTFORML 「This way I can put you wherever I want. It's all part of my plan.」
			PRINTFORMDL It seems you've been captured for some reason.
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORMDL You turn and ask Nitori why she's holding onto you like that.
			PRINTFORML 「I just felt like it, that's all.」
			PRINTFORMDL She's certainly come out of her shell...
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
WAIT
RETURN 1

